From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] qemu-xilinx: check glibc version for sched_attr

glibc 2.41 and newer defines struct sched_attr, but the Wrynose SDK
headers do not define SCHED_ATTR_SIZE_VER0. Keep QEMU's fallback struct
only for older glibc releases and non-glibc hosts.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Xilinx QEMU fork compatibility]
---
 linux-user/syscall.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/linux-user/syscall.c b/linux-user/syscall.c
--- a/linux-user/syscall.c
+++ b/linux-user/syscall.c
@@ -362,3 +362,8 @@
 /* sched_attr is not defined in glibc < 2.41 */
-#ifndef SCHED_ATTR_SIZE_VER0
+#ifdef __GLIBC__
+#if __GLIBC_PREREQ(2, 41)
+#define QEMU_GLIBC_HAS_SCHED_ATTR
+#endif
+#endif
+#ifndef QEMU_GLIBC_HAS_SCHED_ATTR
 struct sched_attr {
